    "text": "COMPLIANCE:\nScene ID: SC_004_003\nAllowed events: The party hikes back to the Outpost Kiosk while Rhea explains the 14.3% skim to Vance.\nForbidden milestones: None\n\nCurrent arm-side / inventory facts: \n- Rhea Mercer holds Scrap Parchment and Charcoal Stick in her left hand, and Makeshift Masonry Bludgeon in her right hand.\n- Vance Harrow holds Rebar in his right hand.\n\nDurable changes committed: \n- Rhea's stamina decreased to 28/100.\n\nAPPEARANCE_CHECK:\n- rhea_mercer: none\n- vance_harrow: none\n- unit_734: none\n\nPROSE:\nHiking back from the Ash Thickets, Rhea explained the math of the deficit to Vance. She marched down the gray dirt trail, her makeshift masonry bludgeon swinging in her right hand while her left clutched the scrap parchment and the charcoal stick.\n\n\"It's not a rounding error,\" Rhea said, tapping the charcoal against the paper. \"It's a 14.3% flat reduction in actual payouts compared to base yields. Every copper, every experience point. It isn\u2019t random. It\u2019s a systemic skim.\"\n\nVance trudged beside her, his scarred face set in a scowl. He hefted his rusted piece of rebar, stepping over a petrified root. \"So the local node is robbing us. Every time we kill a boar, every time we turn in a quest, it pockets fourteen point three percent.\"\n\n\"Exactly,\" Rhea said, glancing down at the makeshift ledger compiled on scrap parchment. \"And it's doing it before the numbers even hit the UI. It's a ghost tax.\"\n\n[Stamina: 28/100]\n\nThe physical toll of the hike registered as a dull ache in her calves, but the sheer audacity of the fraud kept her moving.\n\nUnit 734 hovered a few paces ahead, its drone chassis twitching erratically. \"This is highly irregular. Mathematical discrepancies of this magnitude trigger automated flags. If you attempt to file a grievance based on this makeshift ledger, the resulting system audit will scrutinize all party activities. We will be purged.\"\n\n\"Let them try,\" Rhea said. \"I didn't force us into a custom liability contract just to get bled dry by a middle manager's side hustle. The system loves its rules. We're going to use them.\"\n\n\"You do not understand the frontier routing logic,\" Unit 734 buzzed, its optical lens dilating in a panic. \"The global system audit flag is currently suppressed. If you submit this proof, you will unsuppress it.\"\n\n[System Overlay Integrity: 88%]\n\n\"I understand fraud,\" Rhea shot back. \"And right now, the math says we have leverage. If the local administrator is stealing from the Ledger, the Ledger is going to want its money back.\"\n\nThey cleared the final rise of the trail. The rusted silhouette of the terminal loomed ahead, its flickering screen casting a sickly light over the gray dirt. \n\nUnit 734 nervously processed the implications of an impending audit as they arrived at the Outpost Kiosk, ready to confront the system's routing logic.\n\nSTATE_PATCH:\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"world_updates\": {\n    \"cast_present\": [\n      \"rhea_mercer\",\n      \"vance_harrow\",\n      \"unit_734\"\n    ],\n    \"location\": \"LOC_OUTPOST_KIOSK\",\n    \"open_threads\": [\n      \"system_debt_trap\",\n      \"party_alliance\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"summary_update\": {\n    \"last_scene\": [\n      \"Hiking back from the Ash Thickets, Rhea explained the math of the deficit to Vance.\",\n      \"She used her makeshift ledger to detail the 14.3% systemic skim on all actual payouts.\",\n      \"Unit 734 panicked over the implications of an impending system audit.\",\n      \"The party arrived at the Outpost Kiosk, ready to confront the system's routing logic.\"\n    ],\n    \"key_events\": [\n      \"Rhea explained the 14.3% deficit to Vance during their hike back.\",\n      \"She used the makeshift ledger compiled on scrap parchment as visual proof.\",\n      \"Unit 734 warned that submitting proof of the skim would unsuppress the global system audit flag.\",\n      \"The party arrive